    rdf:value """Tuesday, August 22, Marina di Massa
Fearful storm, then fine
Bathed twice.
B.B. and I went over to Forte to see Lina and have tea with the Consul and his wife. Very boring, the latter. She is a silly woman. """^^xsd:string ;
